# HOMEPAGE DESIGN AUDIT SPRINT
## Systematic Observation, Orientation, Decisions, Actions

**Audit Date**: 2026-03-27
**Scope**: Complete homepage design system audit
**Sequence**: Foundation → Layout → Components → Content → Polish

================================================================================
PHASE 0 — OBSERVE (Current State Documentation)
================================================================================

## O.1 Homepage Section Architecture
```
page.tsx
├── Hero (full viewport, independent) @app/components/features/homepage/hero/Hero.tsx
├── Shelf (fullBleed) + Featured Carousel @app/components/features/homepage/featured/Featured.tsx
├── Shelf + ProductSpotlight1/2/3 (3 editorial sections) @app/components/features/homepage/product-spotlight-{1,2,3}/
├── Shelf (fullBleed) + IemsGallery Grid @app/components/features/homepage/iems-gallery/IemsGallery.tsx
├── Shelf + NewestRelease @app/components/features/homepage/newest-release/NewestRelease.tsx
├── Shelf (fullBleed) + Dacs Carousel @app/components/features/homepage/dacs/Dacs.tsx
└── Shelf (fullBleed) + Accessories @app/components/features/homepage/accessories/Accessories.tsx
```

## O.2 Data Schema (Sanity)
**Source**: @sanity/schemaTypes/homepageDataType.ts

**Document Structure**:
- `featuredProducts[]`: { productRef, productPromo }
- `spotlight1Data/2Data/3Data`: { productRef, promoTitle, promoSubtitle, promoText }
- `iemsGallery[]`: Product references
- `newestReleaseData`: { productRef, promoTitle, promoSubtitle, promoText }
- `dacs[]`: Product references
- `accessoriesCables/earpads/storage[]`: Product references

## O.3 Design System Tokens (Verified)
**Source**: @tailwind.config.ts

**Color System**:
- Brand: 50-900 scale, primary dark theme base (brand-900: #070808)
- Surface: page, card, elevated, subtle, highlight, productImage
- Text: heroHeadline, heroSubHeadline, headline, subtitle, body, caption, accent

**Typography Aliases**:
- `.type-hero-headline` — Display 1, bold, brand-400
- `.type-hero-sub` — H2, medium, secondary-300
- `.type-section-hed` — H1, semibold, brand-400
- `.type-section-sub` — H2, medium, secondary-300
- `.type-body` — 16px/24px, regular, brand-200
- `.type-price` — H4, semibold, secondary-300

**Component Classes**:
- `.btn-primary`, `.btn-secondary`, `.btn-ghost`, `.btn-cart`
- `.card-base`, `.card-product` (unified)
- `.section-header-anchor` (decorative line)

**Layout Tokens**:
- `max-w-content`: 1280px
- `py-20`: Section vertical rhythm (80px)
- `px-4 md:px-8`: Gutters (16px mobile, 32px desktop)

## O.4 Layout System Analysis
**Shelf Component**: @app/components/layout/general/Shelf.tsx
- Owns vertical spacing: `py-20`
- Owns horizontal gutters: `px-4 md:px-8`
- Wraps all sections except Hero
- `fullBleed` prop for edge-to-edge backgrounds

**Carousel System**: @app/components/layout/carousel/
- Context-based state management
- CSS variable `--visible-count` for slide width
- Touch targets: 32px visual, 48px hit area via pseudo-element

**Grid System**: @app/components/layout/grid/Grid.tsx
- Used only in IemsGallery
- 2 cols mobile, 3 cols md, 4 cols lg

## O.5 Section Background Pattern (Current)
```
Hero: bg-black (independent)
Featured: bg-brand-900 (dark)
Spotlight1/2/3: bg-brand-700 (mid)
IemsGallery: bg-brand-900 (dark)
NewestRelease: bg-brand-800 (deep)
Dacs: bg-brand-900 (dark)
Accessories: bg-brand-700 (mid)
```
→ Alternating rhythm maintained ✓

## O.6 Card Component Inventory
| Component | Background | Aspect Ratio | Card Class |
|-----------|-----------|--------------|------------|
| FeaturedCard | bg-surface-productImage | aspect-[4/3] | card-product |
| DacCard | bg-surface-productImage | aspect-[4/3] | card-product |
| IemCard | bg-surface-productImage | aspect-square | card-product |
| AccessoryCard | bg-surface-productImage | aspect-[4/3] | card-product |

## O.7 Breakpoint Architecture
**Tailwind Screens**:
- xs: 475px
- sm: 640px
- md: 768px
- lg: 1024px
- xl: 1280px
- 3xl: 1920px

**Custom Screens**:
- `lg-touch`: (min-width: 1024px) and (max-height: 850px)
- `lg-desktop`: (min-width: 1024px) and (min-height: 851px)

## O.8 Visual Decoration System
**Fractal Ring Pattern** (bg-fractal-ring via Tailwind config):
- Applied to: Featured, Spotlight promo panels, Accessories
- 3-layer depth effect: Large (low opacity), Medium, Small (high opacity)
- REMOVED from: IemsGallery, Dacs (clean gallery look)

================================================================================
PHASE 1 — ORIENT (Gap Analysis & Strategic Decisions)
================================================================================

## GAP 1.1 Content Layer — Text Copies
**Observation**: Product spotlight promo texts are placeholder/default
**Location**: Sanity `homepageData` document, spotlight1/2/3Data fields
**Impact**: Editorial voice inconsistent, not brand-aligned
**Decision**: DEFER — Separate content sprint with copywriter

## GAP 1.2 Navigation Layer — CTA Functionality
**Observation**: Hero button and "See More" buttons lack href/link
**Location**: @app/components/features/homepage/hero/Hero.tsx:88-96
**Impact**: Dead click, poor UX
**Decision**: ACT — Add navigation links in Sprint Phase 4

## GAP 1.3 Accessibility — ARIA Labels
**Observation**: Carousel controls lack aria-labels in some instances
**Location**: @app/components/layout/carousel/CarouselControls.tsx
**Impact**: Screen reader navigation impaired
**Decision**: ACT — Add default aria-labels

## GAP 1.4 Responsive — Mobile Spotlight Spacing
**Observation**: No distance between consecutive spotlights on mobile
**Location**: @app/(store)/page.tsx shelf wrappers
**Impact**: Visual compression, hard to distinguish sections
**Decision**: ACT — Add section spacing on mobile viewports

## GAP 1.5 Performance — Image Loading Strategy
**Observation**: All images use priority/loading correctly
**Location**: All card components verified
**Status**: RESOLVED ✓ — First slide eager, subsequent lazy

## GAP 1.6 Visual — Typography Consistency
**Observation**: Section headers use mixed patterns
- FeaturedHeader: type-overline (correct)
- DacsHeader: type-overline (correct)
- IemsGalleryHeader: type-overline (correct)
- AccessoriesHeader: type-overline (correct)
**Status**: RESOLVED ✓ — All unified

## GAP 1.7 Code Quality — Hardcoded Values
**Observation**: No hardcoded max-w-[1280px] found in current codebase
**Observation**: No inline boxShadow styles found
**Status**: RESOLVED ✓ — Token system fully adopted

================================================================================
PHASE 2 — DECIDE (Scope Contracts & Sequencing)
================================================================================

SEQUENCE RATIONALE:
1. Structure (navigation, a11y) — unblock user journeys
2. Layout (spacing, rhythm) — visual breathing room
3. Content (copies, CTAs) — messaging layer
4. Polish (interactions, edge cases) — refinement

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE CONTRACT 2.1 — Hero CTA Navigation
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files: @app/components/features/homepage/hero/Hero.tsx

**Deliverable State**:
- Hero CTA button navigates to /products
- Button is semantic <a> tag styled as button
- No visual change to styling

**In Scope**:
- Replace <button> with <a> tag
- Add href="/products"
- Preserve all existing styling classes

**Out of Scope**:
- Changing hero layout
- Changing hero typography
- Adding new props

**Forbidden**:
- Using JavaScript navigation (onClick router.push)
- Changing button styling
- Adding external link behavior

**Verification**:
- [ ] Click navigates to /products
- [ ] Keyboard accessible (Tab + Enter)
- [ ] No visual regression

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE CONTRACT 2.2 — Product Spotlight CTAs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files: @app/components/features/homepage/product-spotlight-{1,2,3}/ProductSpotlight{1,2,3}.tsx

**Deliverable State**:
- Each "See More" button links to product detail page
- Button navigates to /products/{product.slug}

**In Scope**:
- Wrap/convert button to <a> with dynamic href
- Use product.slug from GROQ data

**Out of Scope**:
- Changing button text
- Changing button styling
- Adding new GROQ fields

**Verification**:
- [ ] Each spotlight links to correct product
- [ ] Slug resolves correctly from Sanity

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE CONTRACT 2.3 — Newest Release CTA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files: @app/components/features/homepage/newest-release/NewestRelease.tsx

**Deliverable State**:
- "See More" button links to product detail page

**Verification**:
- [ ] Links to /products/{product.slug}

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE CONTRACT 2.4 — Carousel ARIA Labels
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files: @app/components/layout/carousel/CarouselControls.tsx

**Deliverable State**:
- CarouselPrevious has aria-label="Previous slide"
- CarouselNext has aria-label="Next slide"
- Labels overridable via props for localization

**In Scope**:
- Add aria-label prop support with defaults
- Defaults: "Previous slide", "Next slide"

**Out of Scope**:
